{
  "_comment": "Arm stripes (G6c; Benika's oni markings): pairs of thin bands round the forearms (`fore`) and the upper arms (`upper`), painted over whatever is there (an overlay: skin, a sleeve), in the main colour, each one texel row (art review: the first bands were half a pixel wide and painted no texel at all on some forms) with a bare row between (on a chibi's 4 px forearm the first band is the row above the wrist's, where a short gauntlet and a pushed-up sleeve leave the arm bare, and the second has no room); they glow in the phase look (glow \"phase\": the hero's phase texture).",
  "id": "markings/arm_stripes",
  "category": "markings",
  "slots": {"main": "primary"},
  "params": {"fore": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "default": 1}, "upper": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "default": 1}},
  "occupies": ["arm_marks"],
  "paint": [
    {
      "cubes": ["forearm_*", "upper_arm_*"],
      "faces": ["north", "south", "east", "west"],
      "y": ["max(elbow_y - 4, wrist_y + 1)", "max(elbow_y - 3, wrist_y + 2)"],
      "overlay": true,
      "pattern": {"type": "solid", "slots": ["main"]},
      "glow": "phase",
      "when": "fore"
    },
    {
      "cubes": ["forearm_*", "upper_arm_*"],
      "faces": ["north", "south", "east", "west"],
      "y": ["elbow_y - 6", "elbow_y - 5"],
      "overlay": true,
      "pattern": {"type": "solid", "slots": ["main"]},
      "glow": "phase",
      "when": "fore"
    },
    {
      "cubes": ["forearm_*", "upper_arm_*"],
      "faces": ["north", "south", "east", "west"],
      "y": ["arm_top - 3.0", "arm_top - 2.2"],
      "overlay": true,
      "pattern": {"type": "solid", "slots": ["main"]},
      "glow": "phase",
      "when": "upper"
    },
    {
      "cubes": ["forearm_*", "upper_arm_*"],
      "faces": ["north", "south", "east", "west"],
      "y": ["elbow_y + 1.6", "elbow_y + 2.4"],
      "overlay": true,
      "pattern": {"type": "solid", "slots": ["main"]},
      "glow": "phase",
      "when": "upper"
    }
  ]
}
